<section class="panel bounty-new"><h2 class="profile-section-heading">Add to Bounty List</h2>
<h3><a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bountyTarget.id %>"><%= bountyTarget.name %></a></h3>
<p>Level <%= bountyTarget.level %> <%= callingName(bountyTarget.className) %> · <%= bountyTarget.health %> / <%= bountyTarget.maxHealth %> Health<%= bountyTarget.temporaryRival?' · Temporary rival':'' %></p>
<p class="<%= bountyPlacement.allowed?'success':'warning' %>" role="status"><%= bountyPlacement.allowed?'Eligible for a new bounty.':bountyPlacement.reason %></p>
<%- include('partials/bounty-quotas',{quota:bountyPlacement.quotas??null}) %>
<form method="post" action="/game/bounties/preview" data-bounty-quote="<%= bountyTarget.id %>"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="targetCharacterId" value="<%= bountyTarget.id %>">
<label for="bounty-amount">Escrowed bounty (1–10,000 gold)</label><input id="bounty-amount" name="amount" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="10000" value="1" required<% if(!bountyPlacement.allowed) { %> disabled<% } %>>
<dl class="profile-gold-flow"><div><dt>Listing fee</dt><dd>10%, rounded up · minimum 1 gold</dd></div><div><dt>Fee for this amount</dt><dd data-bounty-fee>Shown on Review</dd></div><div><dt>Total gold required</dt><dd class="gold" data-bounty-total>Shown on Review</dd></div><div><dt>Your available unbanked gold</dt><dd class="gold"><%= state.gold.toLocaleString('en') %></dd></div></dl>
<p class="compact-help" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-bounty-quote-status></p><p class="compact-help">Review calculates the exact fee and total on the server for your chosen amount. No charge until confirmation. Vault funds cannot fund bounties directly.</p>
<button class="button button-gold" type="submit" aria-label="Place bounty on <%= bountyTarget.name %>"<% if(!bountyPlacement.allowed) { %> disabled<% } %>>Review bounty</button></form>
<p class="compact-help">Sponsorship crosses all levels; account and progress requirements still apply. In any rolling 24 hours: at most <%= bountyRules.sponsorTargetDailyLimit %> placements by you on the same target and <%= bountyRules.targetDailyLimit %> on that target across all sponsors. Expiry after 24 hours returns the full principal; the disclosed fee is retained. You cannot claim a bounty you fund. Only another eligible finishing attacker receives escrow and one kill. Relisting at 0 Health is allowed; attacking waits for positive Health from normal recovery.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="/game/players/<%= bountyTarget.id %>">Back to profile ›</a></section>
<script type="module" src="/assets/bounties.js?v=historical-bounty-1"></script>
